# changelog

- 2026-09-07: 在用户明确授权后，将 ticker initialization 低频摘要迁移应用到远端 Supabase。远端 migration history 已登记为 `20260907061350_ticker_initialization_summaries`；本地迁移文件、离线检查与运维记录同步为该版本，避免未来 `db push` 重复识别同一 DDL。已核验表、RLS、SECURITY INVOKER RPC 及 anon/authenticated/service_role 权限；未写入业务摘要、未启动 ticker 或模型任务。

- 2026-09-06: 调优 Persistent Runtime V2 的 W1/W2 Responses 缓存：实测确认原 `x-dashscope-session-cache: enable` 只在完整请求复现时高命中、不同 Case 的公共 Event/Policy 前缀三种布局均为 0；保留 Responses API，改用官方 compatible endpoint 与默认隐式缓存，将 W1-R1 index、W1-R2 Event Detail、W2-R1 projection、W2-R2 Policy Detail、W1-R3 source message 确定性序列化为只读业务前缀，动态 Case 后置，远端不再继承 `previous_response_id` 但保留本地 lineage，并在 turn 记录 `prefix_fingerprint`。真实 round 测试的 W1-R1/W2-R1/W1-R2/W2-R2/W1-R3 缓存占比分别为 81.39%/88.51%/69.32%/41.23%/71.77%；最终 MU-W12-018 Case 技术完成，首轮缓存 10,368/25,413（40.80%），立即暖重复为 23,168/26,970（85.90%）。新增可复现 AB/逐轮验收脚本及报告；Responses usage 未返回 `cache_creation_input_tokens`，未作推断。

- 2026-09-05: Ticker initialization V2 收尾：补齐默认生产链路、adopt/invalidate 与候选独立 rerun；D1/D2/D3/O2 内部 turn 冻结调用和 PRE-NODE workspace 快照，签名隔离 fork 只执行选中节点、不发布或激活后继。补齐 O2 repair 预算、历史分页 checkpoint/异步抓取、CDECR 原生任务预算与成果认领、NOOP 空库发布、执行来源摘要、消费者长任务心跳、启动失败回退恢复、SIGTERM 与客户端关闭。Supabase 仅写低频有界摘要并补迁移/RLS 离线检查，新增默认阶段故障矩阵、真实组件启动与 Compile 重跑测试及运维手册。下面早期条目的“仍待完成”已由本项与最新实施记录取代；未做真实 ticker/模型验收、远端迁移或部署。

- 2026-09-05: Ticker initialization 启动链接线：注册默认生产 DAG/adapter factory，增加 revision prepare/commit、真实 Bus/Runtime 循环 admission ACK、启动等待及替换失败 CAS 回退；配置安装支持回退后同 operation 再接纳，人工恢复重开启动节点但不清 cursor。新增 activate/replace-artifact/rollback CLI、依赖成果在 attempt 开始时冻结、CDECR O2 workspace namespace 隔离和共享 volume 的 opt-in compose overlay。Supabase 低频白名单 RPC sink/后台 flush 与本地迁移已准备，未执行远端迁移；内部独立 rerun、adopt/invalidate 与全链矩阵仍待完成，不宣称全部落地。

## 2026-08-20

- Regenerated the persistent C1/C3/C4/O4-A Pilot cases after the Data MCP contract tightened its excluded namespace from `tavily.search` to all `tavily.*`. The new cases seal catalogs and enabled-tool lists from the same current source, eliminating the Codex App startup failure caused by stale immutable catalogs.

- Added the implementation-ready Global Research / Market Situation Research two-lane rearchitecture plan. It defines the C4 pre-scan -> parallel C1/C3 -> C5 -> C4 enrichment Global Research DAG, separates C2/O4 into an independently runnable Market Situation lane, removes C4 finalization from the new path, blocks event-library context from Global Research, and inventories the required runtime, persistence, API, Prompt, Skill, Pilot, documentation, compatibility, and test changes. This planning step does not modify runtime code or databases.

## 2026-08-19

- Recovered all 19 active D1 Pilot cases by rotating their expired Data MCP capability to a 10-year lifetime, preserving every sealed input hash and recording per-case refresh audit metadata. Future Pilot generation now uses the same long-lived default.

- Added the implementation-ready CDECR runtime token and quality recovery plan. It restores side-effect-free bounded concurrency for Field planned Prepare, unifies and audits single-item Field repair validation and Token usage, disables N9 overlap packing, removes only the tightened Parent Induction boundary sentence, and closes the Grounder PRIMARY shadow-to-repair comparison without enabling Apply. No runtime code or real-model acceptance was changed in this planning step.

## 2026-08-18

- Unified manual C4 upstream injection around `c4_finalization.json.json` so C1, C3, all three C4 turns, and O4-A can be regenerated from one validated NodeOutput file while preserving each node's independent output contract.

- Added long-lived Pilot Data MCP capabilities (10-year default) and a redacted capability rotation utility for existing cases. Refreshes change only the case config/manifest metadata, preserve the sealed input hash, and record a local audit sidecar.

- Rewrote `D:\DoxAgentPilot\runtime\UPSTREAM_SETS.md` in Chinese with the D1 dependency order, per-node filename allowlist, staged generation workflow, immutable-case rules, citation boundaries, and quality/bootstrap guidance.

- Added the current-state handoff `dev_plan/workflow_v2/document1_codex_sdk_current_state_20260818.md` for planning Document 2. It records the implemented Document 1 v2 DAG, node artifacts, Codex worker/SDK lifecycle, persistence and retry boundaries, and the still-legacy Document 2 handoff contract.

- Aligned Pilot case manifests with Data MCP's ticker-scoped allowlist so US cases no longer expect the HK-only `yfinance_hk_basic_snapshot` tool during Doctor checks.

- Added reproducible manual upstream injection for isolated Codex D1 Pilot cases. `prepare_case.py --upstream-dir` now imports only node-allowed Markdown/C4 NodeOutput files, replaces matching source-run handoffs, clears incompatible normalized observations, downgrades old attempt citations, records source/injected hashes, and seals the files into the immutable attempt bundle and `input_sha256`. Added persistent upstream-set documentation, task-level precedence/reverification guidance, and focused compatibility, validation, mapping, and hash regressions.

- Decoupled CDECR model profiles from invocation channels and scheduler lanes. M2/M3/M4 now resolve to `deepseek-v4-flash-0731` with `none`/`low`/`high` effort, while Grounder, Parent, Atomic escalation/late convergence, Judge, and Package V3 retain their existing Chat/Responses transports and physical concurrency lanes. Package V3 clustering now uses M3-low and Description uses M2-none; Relevance remains an independent M2-none Responses request. Rolled back the Dreamer 24-candidate cap tie-breaker, added route/audit regressions, and left strict mode, batching, repair/fail-open, provider caps, and concurrency settings unchanged.

